 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
═══════════════════════════════════════

What is this?
  - Automated test suite for TN EMIS (Education Management Information System)
  - Built with Playwright + JavaScript using Page Object Model (POM)
  - Supports both Angular and React versions of the same application
  - Data-driven testing using Excel (TestData.xlsx)
  - Multi-environment: Staging & Production
  - Multi-browser: Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Mobile, Tablet

Why Automation?
  - TN EMIS is migrating from Angular → React
  - Need to verify React modules work same as Angular
  - Multiple user roles (BEO, BEO1, BRC, CEO, DEO, etc.) each with different menus
  - Manual testing of 60+ modules across roles is time-consuming
  - Catch regression bugs early when developers push new code


