 4. KEY FEATURES
═══════════════════════════════════════

A) MULTI-FRAMEWORK SUPPORT
   - Same tests run on both Angular and React
   - Switch with: $env:UI_FRAMEWORK="react"
   - Separate locators for each framework in locatorsPage.js

B) DATA-DRIVEN TESTING
   - Excel file with columns: SNo | Name | Key | staging | production
   - Multiple users per role (BEO user 1, 2, 3...)
   - Change USER_NUMBER in spec file to test different users
   - Environment-aware: staging data vs production data

C) ROLE-BASED TEST STRUCTURE
   - Each designation (BEO, BEO1, BRC, CEO, DEO) has its own folder
   - Menus differ per role — tests match actual menu access
   - Folder structure mirrors the application menu hierarchy

D) AUTOMATED EMAIL REPORTS
   - After test run, report sent to email automatically
   - Shows: which files ran, pass/fail count, duration
   - Includes CSV attachments with detailed results

E) ALLURE REPORTING
   - Beautiful visual reports
   - Test history tracking across runs
   - Screenshot on failure, video recording, trace files

F) ANGULAR vs REACT COMPARISON
   - Side-by-side testing of both platforms
   - Bug detection for migration issues
   - Menu count comparison, UI differences logged

G) PLAYWRIGHT MCP (AI-POWERED TESTING)
   - Live browser control via Kiro AI
   - Observe modules in real-time
   - Generate test code based on actual page behavior
   - Headed mode for visual demonstration


