 5. HOW TO RUN (DEMO COMMANDS)
═══════════════════════════════════════

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Run single test (Chrome)
npx playwright test "tests/e2e/TN_EMIS/Block_User/BEO_Login/BEO.spec.js" --project=chromium

# Run all BEO1 tests
