 11. HOW TO ADD A NEW TEST
═══════════════════════════════════════

1. Create spec file in the correct folder:
   tests/e2e/TN_EMIS/Block_User/BEO1_Login/<Module>/<TestName>.spec.js

2. Import fixtures and data:
   import { test, expect } from "../../../../../../src/fixtures/pageFixtures.js";
   import { getRoleDashboardDataBySNo } from "../../../../../../data/index.js";

3. Login in beforeEach:
   test.beforeEach(async ({ beo1Page }) => {
       await beo1Page.gotoLoginPage(loginData.url);
       await beo1Page.login(loginData.username, loginData.password);
   });

4. Navigate to module and test:
   test("My test", async ({ page }) => {
       await page.goto("https://tnemis-staging.tnsed.com/my-module");
       await expect(page.locator('...')).toBeVisible();
   });

5. Run:
   npx playwright test "tests/e2e/.../MyTest.spec.js" --project=chromium


